fix(i18n): add the missing preset_settings_inactive tooltip key

The preset-settings button's tooltip rendered the raw key
`tooltips.preset_settings_inactive` instead of text, because that key
was never added to either locale file. The call site masked it with
`(t as any)(...)`, which is also why the type system never caught it.

Add the key to zh/en and drop the `as any` casts so these lookups are
type-checked again: a missing key becomes a compile error rather than a
raw identifier shown to the user.